The unix groups, other than the primary groups of the accounts rootless_users
lists, the objects of this namespace may run rootless containers as, by name
or by gid.

A rootless container runs as the group its rootless_group keyword names, or
the primary group of its account. The group reaches every file of the node it
owns, so a group like docker or disk would reach the node itself: only the
squatter lists them. The root group is never allowed, whatever it says.
